{"3848800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEATHMOON", "steam_appid": 3848800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DEATHMOON</i></strong> is a brutal roguelike boomer shooter set in an underground moon complex. Carve your way through layers of the moon with an <strong>arsenal of powerful weapons</strong>. Use the <strong>tight and fine-tuned movement</strong> to your advantage to get out of tough situations.. <i>or just punch your way out of them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/bf65d6a489c950de732c6456ce31a4ff.poster.avif?t=1780586462\" width=546 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/bf65d6a489c950de732c6456ce31a4ff.webm?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/bf65d6a489c950de732c6456ce31a4ff.mp4?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Inspired heavily by The Binding of Isaac, this game relies on <strong>synergies</strong> as its main fun factor. Every new weapon you find can be enhanced with either a <i>blessing</i> or a <i>curse</i> (or both) to offer a vast amount of variety.   <br>  <br>Found the weapon of your choice? Now it's time to squeeze out all its potential with the ridiculous number of items you find across the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.poster.avif?t=1780586462\" width=400 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.webm?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.mp4?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill will be put to the test at the end of each layer. Show that you have what it takes, or die permanently.   <br>  <br>When you manage to survive the dangers of the moon, grab yourself a rod and replenish your sanity. <i>You will need it down there..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/28338c1a1de7948256e374405c5911bc.poster.avif?t=1780586462\" width=576 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/28338c1a1de7948256e374405c5911bc.webm?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/28338c1a1de7948256e374405c5911bc.mp4?t=1780586462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated rooms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 Pickupable weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Weapon modifiers (blessings and curses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 Pickupable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Layers, each with unique boss at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Secret layer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DEATHMOON</i></strong> 